    # mc "You and I had just started to get to know each other... I didn't know, I swear."
    mc "你和我刚开始互相了解……我真的不知道，我发誓。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:231
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_1509818b:

    # mc "I know that doesn't undo what I did, and when I found out you were related... I... I..."
    mc "我知道这不能抹去我做过的事，当我发现你和她有关系……我……我……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:232
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_5017bbed:

    # mc "I've felt guilty ever since. And I can't go on pretending it didn't happen."
    mc "从那以后我一直感到内疚，我再也无法假装那件事没发生过。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:234
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_91fa6c9f:

    # sa "And when did you find out that she's my mom?"
    sa "那你是什么时候知道她是我的妈妈的？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:236
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_f2cb79a9:

    # mc "After we decided to date... Back when we visited your place together with Josy and Maya..."
    mc "我们决定在一起之后……那时候我们和Josy、Maya一起去了你家……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:238
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_d8bc3d3d:

    # mc "I realized that I had been there before...and my stomach turned."
    mc "我意识到我之前来过这里……我的胃又开始绞痛了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:240
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_f46bb024:

    # mc "That's when it clicked...and my stomach turned."
    mc "那就是时候了……我的胃又开始翻腾了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:241
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_ec4697e9:

    # mc "I wanted to tell you earlier...but I've felt so guilty, and I didn't know how to say it."
    mc "我想早点告诉你……但一直觉得内疚，不知道该怎么开口。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:243
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_436cde4e:

    # mc "I couldn't undo it, and I was scared of losing you."
    mc "我没办法撤销这件事，我害怕会失去你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:244
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_038a438e:

    # mc "But the longer I waited, the worse the guilt got."
    mc "但等得越久，愧疚感就越严重。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:245
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_0f78888a:

    # mc "The more my feelings for you grew, the guiltier I felt."
    mc "我对你的感情越深，就越觉得内疚。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:246
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_fb10e8a8:

    # mc "I considered all the options I had... Telling you, not telling you, breaking up with you to spare your relationship with your mom..."
    mc "我考虑过所有可能的选项……告诉你，不告诉你，甚至和你分手，以免影响你和你妈妈的关系……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:248
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_8e3fb764:

    # mc "But I realized that if there was a chance that you could forgive me, I had to try."
    mc "但我意识到，如果还有机会得到你的原谅，我必须尝试。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:249
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_7d9199bd:

    # mc "I'm so sorry."
    mc "我真的很抱歉。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:251
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_4aaed24b:

    # sa "You didn't know she was my mother!? Is that your defense!?"
    sa "你不知道她是我的妈？这就是你的借口？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:253
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_67f314e3:

    # mc "It is. Try to put yourself in my shoes."
    mc "是的。试着站在我的角度想想。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:256
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_3fd0062c:

    # sa "Does that make it any better? I would never do that with a teacher."
    sa "这能让你好受点吗？我绝对不会和老师搞那种事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:258
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_86451848:

    # sa "Does that make it any better? I would never fuck a teacher."
    sa "这能让你感觉好点吗？我绝不会跟老师搞那种事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:259
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_268256ea:

    # sa "Who are you? I feel like I don't know you."
    sa "你是谁？我感觉我根本不认识你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:261
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_8d2033d5:

    # mc "I made a mistake. I admit it. But I can't take it back."
    mc "我犯了一个错。我承认。但已经无法挽回了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:264
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_6ee5031e:

    # sa "And you waited all this fucking time to tell me!"
    sa "你他妈等了这么久才告诉我！"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:265
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_bb56deb0_1:

    # sa "Get the fuck out of here! Leave!!!"
    sa "滚出去！给我滚！！！"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:268
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_0618ec75:

    # sa "Who does that to someone!?"
    sa "谁干的！？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:270
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_b933bdb9_1:

    # sa "Ow!!!"
    sa "哎哟！！！"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:272
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_f53cfd42_1:

    # mc "Sage... Please..."
    mc "Sage...求你了..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:275
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_b7df48d0:

    # sa "I thought I loved you. I wanted to be with you..."
    sa "我以为我爱上了你。我想和你在一起……"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:276
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_25a0906e:

    # sa "We are so over, [name]. I can't even look at you."
    sa "我们彻底完了，[name]我甚至不敢看你。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:278
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_0aaaddd7:

    # mc "Please... Sage... I don't want this to end."
    mc "求你... Sage... 我不想就这样结束。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:280
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_9b308c4a:

    # sa "Well, guess what..."
    sa "嗯，猜猜看？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:281
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_118be0fb:

    # sa "This ended the moment your dick touched my mother."
    sa "这结束于你那玩意碰到我妈妈的那一刻。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:282
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_7ac98fb0:

    # sa "Get the fuck out of my sight!"
    sa "滚开，别让我再看见你！"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:287
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_47a90b1c:

    # mc "{i}I thought about that moment a lot...{/i}"
    mc "{i}我经常回想那个时刻...{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:288
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_e108766b:

    # mc "{i}What would have happened if I hadn't confessed?{/i}"
    mc "{i}如果我没坦白会怎样？{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:290
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_f2f87a48:

    # mc "{i}But I did it to try to save our relationship.{/i}"
    mc "{i}但我这么做是为了挽救我们的关系。{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:292
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_74ab67c9:

    # mc "{i}And I don't regret it.{/i}"
    mc "{i}我没后悔。{/i}"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:304
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_112a442e:

    # mc "Your brother is an ass."
    mc "你兄弟是个蠢货。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:309
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_f0544190:

    # sa "Yes, he is."
    sa "是的，他就是。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:314
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_c151a057:

    # mc "Aren't you gonna ask what he did?"
    mc "你不会打算问他是干啥了吧？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:319
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_6798a690:

    # sa "Oh, did he do something?"
    sa "他干了什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:324
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_82d521ef:

    # mc "He dropped by to threaten us earlier."
    mc "他刚才来威胁了我们一下。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:329
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_1216abfa:

    # sa "He does that a lot. I wouldn't put much weight into it."
    sa "他经常这样。别太当真。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:334
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_bda7f86a:

    # sa "That party you threw got people on Rooster talking."
    sa "那场你办的派对让Rooster的人都在议论纷纷。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:339
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_15587254:

    # mc "What are they saying?"
    mc "他们都在说些什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:344
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_43ef49ce:

    # sa "There's a mix of reactions. Some say it was unhinged and derogatory, while many say it was one of the best parties of the year."
    sa "反应各不相同。有人说是疯了又带侮辱性，但很多人说这是今年最棒的派对之一。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:349
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_0c0d787a:

    # mc "What can I say? You missed out on a good one."
    mc "有什么好说的？你错过了一个不错的派对。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:354
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_b467092e:

    # sa "I'd say Bella's party was better."
    sa "我觉得贝拉的派对更好。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:360
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_83a6d3a9:

    # mc "The people on Rooster don't need to know that."
    mc "那些在Rooster的人没必要知道这些。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:362
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_dcdac24d:

    # mc "I doubt it."
    mc "我可不信。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:372
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_561fb4a1:

    # mc "Speaking of that party..."
    mc "说到那场派对..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:373
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_31637b6d:

    # mc "There's something that happened during it that you should know about."
    mc "发生了一件你应该知道的事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:378
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_bff5989a:

    # sa "Something juicy?"
    sa "有啥好料？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:383
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_ce96bb20:

    # mc "Zoey dropped by."
    mc "Zoey来了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:388
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_ced54516:

    # sa "I don't like where this is going."
    sa "我不喜欢事情发展的方向。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:393
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_39ecb7d1:

    # mc "Nothing happened between us. I mean, something happened, but you shouldn't worry about it."
    mc "我们之间什么都没发生。我是说，确实发生了点什么，但你不用担心。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:398
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_bd5aad73:

    # sa "Spit it out."
    sa "说吧。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:403
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_28fdb51c:

    # mc "She told me she loves me. And she wanted us to get back together."
    mc "她跟我说她爱我，还想要我们重新在一起。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:408
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_a9d45022:

    # sa "What the fuck?"
    sa "什么鬼？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:413
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_a7a204e0:

    # mc "Don't get mad."
    mc "别生气。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:418
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_82338c06:

    # sa "Don't get mad!? Didn't I tell you something along these lines would happen?"
    sa "别生气？我之前不是跟你说过这种事迟早会发生吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:423
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_00c0fb29:

    # mc "You did. But you never had to worry about how I felt."
    mc "你确实这么说了。但你根本不用管我怎么想。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:428
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_67624e67:

    # sa "What did you tell her?"
    sa "你跟她说什么了？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:433
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_eaff8c37:

    # mc "I told her it was too late for anything to happen. I rejected her."
    mc "我跟她说已经太晚了，什么都不会发生了。我拒绝了她。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:434
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_b2a0711a:

    # mc "And even though I knew this would upset you, I wanted you to know that it happened. You were right."
    mc "虽然我知道这会让你不开心，但我还是想让你知道这件事发生了。你没错。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:444
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_69340aa0:

    # sa "Thank you... I appreciate that you told me."
    sa "谢谢... 我知道你告诉我这些是出于好意。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:445
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_85bf7088:

    # sa "But that she did that to you... That makes me fume."
    sa "但她说你了……这让我火大。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:450
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_abe0cc12:

    # mc "Again. Nothing happened between us, Sage. She's just my friend."
    mc "又怎样，Sage。我们之间什么都没发生，她只是我的朋友。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:455
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_4a66a42a:

    # sa "Wait! What?"
    sa "等等！什么？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:460
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "嗯？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:465
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_1b101207:

    # sa "Are you still calling her your friend? She told you she loves you. How can you be friends with her after that?"
    sa "你还在叫她你的朋友吗？她已经告诉你她爱你了。她这样对你之后，你还能把她当朋友吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:470
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_796186c2:

    # mc "I mean, I... It doesn't change how I feel about her. She's still my childhood friend."
    mc "我是说，我……这不会改变我对她的感觉。她还是我儿时的朋友。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:475
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_ba288ff1:

    # sa "Come on, dude. You have to see it now. She doesn't look at you as a friend anymore."
    sa "行啊，伙计。你得明白现在的情况。她现在根本不再把你当朋友看了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:476
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_001f8c29:

    # sa "She looks at you as someone who got away."
    sa "她看你就像一个错过的家伙。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:481
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_c9ddba77:

    # sa "How can you possibly expect that to remain a friendship?"
    sa "你怎么可能还指望那还能是友情？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:482
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_542739b2:

    # sa "It makes me feel ten times worse about you spending time with her now that I know her true intentions."
    sa "现在我知道她的真实意图，你跟她在一块，我感觉更糟了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:483
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_07fbddf8:

    # sa "Before, it was just a hunch. Now, I know for sure."
    sa "以前只是个猜测，现在我确定了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:488
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_50a4da8c:

    # mc "I get what you're saying, but..."
    mc "我明白你的意思，但..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:493
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_0b00034c:

    # sa "But you still want to be her friend."
    sa "但你还是想和她做朋友。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:498
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_0572d01b:

    # mc "I haven't given it much thought."
    mc "我没怎么想这件事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:500
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_3de344fb:

    # mc "Do you want me to stop being Camila's friend now, too?"
    mc "你是不是也想让我现在就停止做Camila的朋友？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:506
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_ae1520f1:

    # sa "That's not the same thing, [name]. What we did with Camila, we did together as a couple."
    sa "那不是同一件事。[name]我们和Camila一起做了情侣的事。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:507
translate schinese ep12_smc_label_3f26a79b:

    # sa "To me, there's only one way to go. You can't stay her friend after this, [name]."
    sa "对我而言，只有一条路可走。你在这之后不可能还当她的朋友，[name]."

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:522
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_07ef6051:

    # sa "*{i}Humming{/i}* Set us free. Set us free. Set us free..."
    sa "*{i}哼着歌{/i}*放我们自由。放我们自由。放我们自由..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:527
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_fcd7a33a:

    # sa "Damn you, catchy Christian radio..."
    sa "操，你这该死的Christian电台..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:532
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_3334174e:

    # mc "Hey... What's this all about?"
    mc "嘿……这到底是怎么回事？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:534
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_368cb6d8:

    # sa "Surprise!"
    sa "惊喜！"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:536
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_d7058095:

    # mc "What's the occasion?"
    mc "什么场合？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:538
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_d9800ab6:

    # sa "It's a \"congrats on making it through your first semester\" kind of occasion."
    sa "这是庆祝你顺利度过第一学期的场合。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:540
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_70892d62:

    # mc "*{i}Phew{/i}* Good. I thought I missed an anniversary or something."
    mc "*{i}呼——{/i}*好的。我以为我错过了什么纪念日。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:542
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_65e8792b:

    # sa "Hilarious."
    sa "好笑死了。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:543
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_90122376:

    # sa "So, how did it go?"
    sa "那怎么样？玩得还行吗？"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:545
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_d250326c:

    # mc "I am beat. Thoroughly beat. All I see when I close my eyes is a white sheet of paper with my writing on it."
    mc "我彻底累垮了。一闭上眼，眼前全是白纸，上面全是我的字迹。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:546
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_dba6f458:

    # mc "I needed this tonight. Thank you for being so sweet to me."
    mc "我今晚真的需要这个。谢谢你对我这么好。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:548
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_bfc73e1b:

    # sa "You're welcome. I wanted you to have a relaxing evening."
    sa "你不用谢。我就是想让你今晚能轻松点。"

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:550
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_9efe3e5b:

    # sa "I prepared something for us to eat..."
    sa "我准备了点东西给我们吃..."

# episode12\branches\ep12_sage_branch.rpy:551
translate schinese ep12_sage_solo_label_c782e612:

    # sa "Something for us to drink..."
    sa "给我们拿点喝的……"

